11. Handle missing optional fields safely.
12. Handle invalid or corrupted backup files safely.
13. Show understandable errors instead of silently failing.
14. Preserve existing valid data if an operation fails.
15. Ensure currency arithmetic is precise and deterministic.

Duplicate detection should compare relevant attributes such as date, amount, category, paid-by member, and transaction type. Treat matches as potential duplicates rather than automatically deleting valid repeated purchases.

Use database transactions for operations that must update multiple related records atomically.

